post.summary:
签发反馈图直传 PUT URL。
 <pre>
 POST /app/v1/oss/presign
 body: { "filename": "a.png", "contentType": "image/png", "size": 12345 }
 → { uploadUrl, objectKey, accessUrl, expireSeconds }
 </pre>

